Description:
    Installs the database tables for collaborative Lexxy editing, and the
    import-map pins when the app uses import maps. The channel ships in the
    gem as LexxyRealtime::DocumentChannel, so the generator doesn't add one
    to the app.

Example:
    bin/rails generate lexxy_realtime:install

    This will create:
        db/migrate/XXXXXXXX_create_y_tables.rb
    The models ship in the gems (Y::Document, Y::DocumentUpdate).
    The generator will remind you to add `import "lexxy-realtime"` to
    your JavaScript entrypoint.
